<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/observing-patients-with-prediabetes> a dmo:Recommendation ;
    rdfs:label "Observing patients with prediabetes" ;
    dmo:recommendationId "observing-patients-with-prediabetes" ;
    dmo:recommendationStrength "Unspecified" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Monitoring" ;
    dmo:statement "If the patient’s diabetes test results are close to—but not within—the diagnostic range of the test, the patient may have prediabetes. Health care professionals may wish to observe patients with prediabetes whose condition is likely to progress, recommend lifestyle modifications, and retest in 3 to 6 months.1" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "If the patient’s diabetes test results are close to—but not within—the diagnostic range of the test, the patient may have prediabetes. Health care professionals may wish to observe patients with prediabetes whose condition is likely to progress, recommend lifestyle modifications, and retest in 3 to 6 months.1" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/niddk-diabetes-prediabetes-tests> .

